# Dirox kit: text files are committed and checked out with LF on every OS, so the CI script copies
# stay identical to the kit's and an edit made on Windows does not show every line as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Dirox kit: okf/log.md only ever gains lines, so a merge keeps both sides' lines instead of
# stopping. GitHub's web conflict editor ignores this; /dirox-dev:close-change merges locally.
# Generated index.md files are not listed: they are regenerated, never merged.
okf/log.md merge=union
